title: Remove deprecated polkadot and omni-node CLI flags
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Removes CLI flags that were deprecated and no longer had any effect, along with the code that handled them.
    For omni-node, removes `--experimental-use-slot-based`. Its warning said the flag would be removed after May 2025. Use `--authoring slot-based` instead.
    For polkadot, Removes `--force-kusama`, `--force-westend` and `--force-rococo`.
crates:
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: major
